OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWindy and
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy overnight, but feeling
OL,7,Frather mild. A few isolated spots of
OL,8,Flight rain are possible, but most
OL,9,Fareas are likely to remain dry.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FCloudy for much of Thursday,
OL,12,Fwith most areas staying dry until a
OL,13,Fband of rain moves southeastwards
OL,14,Facross the region later in the
OL,15,Fafternoon. Breezy throughout and mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
